			"Message": "feat(Grove): Wire VS Code API facade to Mountain transport and implement service registration\n\nConnect the VSCodeAPI facade (CommandNamespace, Window, Workspace, WorkspaceConfiguration, DiagnosticCollection, LanguageNamespace) to a Mountain transport for command execution, notifications, configuration, and diagnostics forwarding. Replace placeholder implementations in ServiceRegister with actual gRPC calls via SpineConnection for service registration, heartbeat, query, and listing. Implement WASM extension activation in ActivationEngine using ModuleLoaderImpl to load, instantiate, and call the exported `activate` function via wasmtime typed funcs. Add transport envelope serialization with base64 payload encoding in CommonAdapter. Expose WASM runtime accessors on ExtensionManager and ModuleLoader for activation wiring.\n\nThis completes the Grove–Mountain integration path for extension hosting: API calls flow from extensions through the VSCode facade to Mountain, service lifecycle is managed via Spine gRPC, and WASM extensions activate natively in-process.",
			"SHA": "24a76aba121aa502e1cc3e4898cb2ff9c82d4822"
